                <div class="bg-orange-500/10 border border-orange-500/20 rounded-2xl p-4 text-xs text-orange-200 leading-relaxed">
                    To connect your Garmin FR55 on your PC, make sure your computer has Bluetooth turned on and that you are opening this page using <strong>Google Chrome</strong> or <strong>Microsoft Edge</strong>.
