                <div class="space-y-2 pt-2 border-t border-slate-800">
                    <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 text-cyan-400 font-semibold text-sm">
                        <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-xs">3</span>
                        <h3>No Bluetooth on PC?</h3>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-300">If your PC doesn't have Bluetooth, click <strong>"Simulate HR"</strong> to test all heart rate tracking features live!</p>
